On the other hand, it's one of my pet peeves. I find that people are all
too quick to add parentheses where they are not needed and forget about
them when they are needed (typically in macro definitions). To my mind,
if an expression is complicated enough that you think excess parentheses
will make its structure more apparent then it should be broken up into
two or more statements.

